'''Abominations''' are aggressive [[creatures]] found in the [[Swamp]]s. They are large tree-like entities comprised of multiple branches and four sturdy roots, which it uses as legs to move around.

Due to its weakness to fire damage, killing it with [[Fire Arrow]]s is a valid option. [[Damage#Slash|Slashing damage]] (Axes, Swords, Knives) takes it down quite rapidly. With a [[Banded Shield]] or better, its attacks can be parried, and the creature defeated surprisingly easily.

