== Attacks and abilities ==
{{For|strategies for defeating Abominations|Aggressive creature strategies#Abomination}}

=== Swing === 
<ref name=":0">The files for the Abomination's attack properties are only numbered Attack 1-3, but the animations are given names. For clarity, the animation names are used.</ref> Swings their right branch at the player in an 11-meter long 45-degree horizontal arc (60 [[Damage types#Blunt|Blunt]], 100 Tier 2 [[Damage types#Chop|Chop]] and 60 Tier 2 [[Damage types#Pickaxe|Pickaxe]] damage). This has a 7-second cooldown and is restricted to when the player is within 2.5–6 meters, meaning it is possible to disable this attack by standing against the center of the Abomination.

=== Slam ===
<ref name=":0" /> Raises their left branch high before pounding it against the ground (80 [[Damage types#Blunt|Blunt]], 100 Tier 2 [[Damage types#Chop|Chop]] and 60 Tier 2 [[Damage types#Pickaxe|Pickaxe]] damage). The impact hits in a 4.3-meter radius circle around the branch. It has an 8-second cooldown and can be used within 3–5 meters of a player, meaning it is possible to disable this attack by standing against the center of the Abomination.

=== Ground slam ===
<ref name=":0" /> Lifts themselves up slightly, before slamming their entire body in the ground (80 [[Damage types#Blunt|Blunt]], 100 Tier 2 [[Damage types#Chop|Chop]] and 60 Tier 2 [[Damage types#Pickaxe|Pickaxe]] damage). This attack hits in a 5.4-meter radius circle around their center. This has a 6-second cooldown and can be used within 0–3 meters of a player.

